      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "THE WILDLING (9) is back from a five-month spell and has transferred to the Freedman yard. Only beaten 1.7 lengths in the Gimcrack on debut last October then didn't come up in the Autumn. Recent trial winner who might be able to realise her potential this prep. TSARDEAL (3) enjoyed dropping back in trip when a handy second over today's course and distance last start. Might have found his niche and is worth following up. DREAM A LITTLE (4) ran a much better race last time out, beaten a long neck over 1000m at Gunnedah. Harder this time but is in the mix at just the third run back. EPIC (1) has been gelded and returns from a 27-week break for Team Hawkes. Led for home at both runs in the maiden prep then dropped off. Should have more to offer this time around. MRS FLANDERS (5) struggled in heavy going first-up over this course and distance. Deserves another chance in better conditions today.",
